      ],
      evolution: 'Basis for many modern climbing games; individual and partnership forms (e.g. Sān jiā xĭ, Huŏjiàn) spread regionally.',
      cultural: "Popular in Shanghai, Zhejiang, Jiangsu; name evokes perseverance; losing players are 'pit dwellers' who give cards to winners in the next hand.",
